{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1499196000"}, "name":{"label":"Snowy 🤍"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-19T01:09:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.25.0"}, "id":{"label":"13863765768"}, "title":{"label":"Our favourite app as a long distance couple ❤️"}, "content":{"label":"Long distance is not easy but this app makes it a little softer ✨💕\nWe track our days, milestones, and it honestly keeps us going 🫶🏻", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id930982304"}, "name":{"label":"KingOfTheNorth2K"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-02T07:33:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.25.0"}, "id":{"label":"13806243089"}, "title":{"label":"Great App!"}, "content":{"label":"Really great app, me and my partner are worried we’ll reach the end of the quizzes so we’ve had to tone down how many we take a day. 😂 \n\nI’d love if an update included a mini games section to play together, maybe deeper discussions on beliefs — “Why do you think Aliens exist” and alternative styles of quizzes, maybe like a Christian worldview pack for the more religious folk out there, or even conflict simulation questions , to discover how conflict styles differ. A voice response feature would be a welcomed addition too. \n\nI can think of loads 😆, but what you have built as it is, at the moment, is amazing and I’m looking forward to seeing how it progresses!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
